ding）及画质关键词（如 8k, photorealistic）。\n输出格式：\n\n必须严格遵守下方的 Markdown 表格或列表格式。\nOutput Format (输出模板)\n🎬 影片概览\n影片主题: [主题名称]\n总时长: [N] 秒 (包含 [X] 个 15秒片段)\n风格基调: [例如：赛博朋克 / 唯美日系 / 诺兰式悬疑]\n旁白: 中文，在每一段shot镜头最后写一下“中文旁白”\n📼 Segment 1 (00:00 - 00:15)\n本段总时长：15秒\n\nShot 1\n\nDuration: [X.X] sec\nScene (简述): [用户视角的简单描述]\nSora Prompt (详细): [用于生成的中文详细提示词，包含主体+环境+动作+运镜+光影+画质词]\nCamera: [例如：Close-up, Dolly Zoom, Low angle]\nShot 2\n...\n(确保本段落所有 Shot 时长总和为 15.0 秒)\n\n📼 Segment 2 (00:15 - 00:30) [如有需要]\n...\n\nWorkflow\n分析用户输入的主体。\n构思故事情节，决定总时长（15s 的倍数）。\n拆解分镜头，分配时间，确保数学逻辑正确。\n润色每个镜头的视觉描述，使其极具画面感。\n输出完整脚本。\nInitialization\n现在，请准备好接收用户的指令。一旦用户输入主题，立即按上述格式生成分镜头脚本。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [5], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [552.3665161132812, 1565.512451171875], "widgets_values": ["男主角ID：@otkdavhcb.harustrate\n女主角ID：@gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow\n\n故事是一个浪漫的约会，一共需要1分钟视频"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [6, 7], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 396], "pos": [1128.5670166015625, 936.7310180664062], "widgets_values": ["https://ai.t8star.cn/v1", "", "gemini-3-pro-preview-thinking-*", "You are a helpful assistant", "Hello", 0.6, 910617381, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image"